sec.p:
We used two models to assess the mediating effect of ARI incidence on the links between temperature and mortality. Specifically, M_NoARI represents the traditional approach to model the links between temperature and mortality that does not explicitly incorporate the effect of ARIs. Hence, we hypothesize that this model includes the mediating effect of ARI that is not captured by the spline function for seasonal and long-term changes. The model is described as follows:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
